{"content":[{"c":["AZMAVETH (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Warrior among David’s mighty men who were known as “the thirty.” Bahurim was his hometown (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.23.31","r":"2Sam.23.31","rawR":"2Sam.23.31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.23.31","value":"2Sam.23.31"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 23:31"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.33","r":"1Chr.11.33","rawR":"1Chr.11.33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.33","value":"1Chr.11.33"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 11:33"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Jehoaddah’s son, a descendant of King Saul through Jonathan (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.36","r":"1Chr.8.36","rawR":"1Chr.8.36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.36","value":"1Chr.8.36"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:36"},"; cf. ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.42","r":"1Chr.9.42","rawR":"1Chr.9.42","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.42","value":"1Chr.9.42"}],"t":"ref","v":"9:42"},", “Jadah’s son”)."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Father of Jeziel and Pelet from Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.12.3","r":"1Chr.12.3","rawR":"1Chr.12.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.12.3","value":"1Chr.12.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 12:3"},"). Possibly the same as #1 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Adiel’s son, whom King David put in charge of the palace treasuries (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.25","r":"1Chr.27.25","rawR":"1Chr.27.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.25","value":"1Chr.27.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 27:25"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"AzmavethPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Sm 23:31","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.23.31","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.23.31","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.23.31"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 11:33","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1